    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle 10 of the great classical composers in this epic classical bullet hell. Get stronger as you advance through the fights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win against each of them by doging their projectile and attacking with your own. Each victory give you a bonus of your choice in this list:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One or two lifes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A faster shooting speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each victory, the action will get more intense as your enemies will have more health and more difficult shooting patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing the game is easy, only stir yourself in the 2D plane to dodge your ennemy bullets. While escaping their attacts, get back at them with projectiles of your own.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle 10 of the great classical composers in this epic classical bullet hell. Get stronger as you advance through the fights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win against each of them by doging their projectile and attacking with your own. Each victory give you a bonus of your choice in this list:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One or two lifes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A faster shooting speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each victory, the action will get more intense as your enemies will have more health and more difficult shooting patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing the game is easy, only stir yourself in the 2D plane to dodge your ennemy bullets. While escaping their attacts, get back at them with projectiles of your own.</p>",
    "short_description": "Battle 10 great composer in this classical bullethell. Will you be able to defeat them all?",
